<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  -----			 O/N = 7.66%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  -----			 T/N = 7.02%</p>
<p>		   Nov 8, 1996			  Nov 7, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.06%	1 month forward =  4.60%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.26%	2 month forward =  4.94%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.22%	3 month forward =  5.67%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.96%	4 month forward =  6.38%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.47%	5 month forward =  6.88%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.49%	6 month forward =  6.83%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
